    <item>
      <title>DlogSort 1.4</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 03:02:57 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{margin:10px 14px;font:13px/1.55 -apple-system,'PingFang SC',sans-serif}ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.1em}li{margin:0 0 6px}p{margin:0 0 8px}</style><ul>
<li><b>支持 D-Log M</b>：可以识别 Osmo Action 5 Pro 等机型拍的 D-Log M 视频，有单独的标记、筛选和统计</li>
<li>D-Log M 视频可以打 DlogM + 绿色 Finder 标签、整理到 DlogM 文件夹，导出到达芬奇时带上 D-Log M 关键词</li>
<li>其他色彩模式（普通、D-Cinelike、HLG 等）也会显示名称</li>
<li>修复 4:3 画幅视频的缩略图时长显示不全</li>
</ul>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Chokamin/DlogSort/releases/download/v1.4/DlogSort.zip" sparkle:edSignature="qCT+8+9NREaN2xoOC53+ndBb5FJSjBBW15ntFsXhHZVGT33jhIeoajqvL0kJj4D1C+TCjAhoWU3PJRNwy8H2DQ==" length="5374698" type="application/octet-stream"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>DlogSort 1.3.1</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:42:59 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{margin:10px 14px;font:13px/1.55 -apple-system,'PingFang SC',sans-serif}ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.1em}li{margin:0 0 6px}p{margin:0 0 8px}</style><ul>
<li><b>修复 Finder 标签颜色丢失</b>：之前在 Finder 里打开「标签…」编辑后颜色会消失。现在 D-Log 视频带上 Dlog 和橙色标签，D-Log2 带上 Dlog2 和紫色标签，编辑标签也不会丢</li>
<li>之前打过标签的文件，重新点一次「打 Finder 标签」即可更新，其他标签会保留</li>
</ul>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Chokamin/DlogSort/releases/download/v1.3.1/DlogSort.zip" sparkle:edSignature="dfcJqa5XCwvdlDQJscuTech3pKT3ZV5fdsm7kTFkfEyPZu9ac8yPr0VfIuYjUfP7GIq99XOcd/cfZMxa+lerAQ==" length="5352750" type="application/octet-stream"/>
    </item>
